517
00:28:23,140 --> 00:28:26,780
uh, we just gotta keep those samurai out.

518
00:28:27,300 --> 00:28:29,717
Besides, since Raizo isn't here,

519
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:32,957
there's no need for Kin'emon and Kanjuro
to enter the country in the first place.

520
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:37,200
I'm sure they're blameless in this matter.

521
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:43,033
But the whole city was destroyed
because of their friend.

522
00:28:43,800 --> 00:28:46,940
Bring Raizo to me or face destruction!

523
00:28:48,260 --> 00:28:50,040
Where is the Wano Warrior?

524
00:28:53,620 --> 00:28:57,149
They were so kind to us even
after all they've been through.

525
00:28:57,280 --> 00:29:00,157
So we can't let them find out
that we're friends with samurai.

526
00:29:00,240 --> 00:29:03,120
It might just break their
fluffy little hearts.

527
00:29:08,220 --> 00:29:09,280
Or worse,

528
00:29:09,580 --> 00:29:12,957
they find out that Kin'emon and his bros
were going to use this place as their.

529
00:29:13,040 --> 00:29:14,040
rendezvous point.

530
00:29:14,540 --> 00:29:18,520
These minks are kind-hearted folks,
but that would piss anyone off.

531
00:29:25,900 --> 00:29:28,724
Last thing I want is to
fight with our new pals.

532
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:30,057
They've suffered enough.

533
00:29:30,140 --> 00:29:32,040
It might not be much fun,

534
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:36,534
but we got to make sure those samurai
don't sneak in and ruin everything.

535
00:29:52,980 --> 00:29:57,862
Well, I would scarcely call it record time,
but we've made it before dawn at least.

536
00:29:58,180 --> 00:29:59,800
The trial is over.

537
00:30:00,140 --> 00:30:03,180
At long last, our courage has won the day.

538
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:11,100
This has been quite the
misadventure, though, honestly.

539
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,617
The others must be quite worried about us.

540
00:30:22,700 --> 00:30:24,157
I do hope they're in good health.

541
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:25,697
I feel a bit guilty.

542
00:30:25,780 --> 00:30:28,457
Well, we shan't keep
them waiting much longer.

543
00:30:28,540 --> 00:30:32,820
What a fine tiger you
are, Torosaburo A tiger?

544
00:30:33,180 --> 00:30:34,837
Yes, of course, a tiger.

545
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,626
The color threw me off a bit.

546
00:30:37,820 --> 00:30:40,360
And yet we must all say goodbye.

547
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,517
My dear monkey fellow.

548
00:30:45,600 --> 00:30:47,077
Please pardon my rudeness.

549
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:48,657
But you have yet to answer our inquiry.

550
00:30:48,740 --> 00:30:51,700
I must know if a warrior
named Race can be.

551
00:30:53,540 --> 00:30:55,297
It's not this monkey's business!

552
00:30:55,380 --> 00:30:58,700
Why are you perspiring
so profusely, my friend?

553
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:01,377
What's the matter?

554
00:31:01,460 --> 00:31:02,540
Why do you flee?

555
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:05,880
We require your assistance
in finding Race.

556
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:07,480
Yes, monkey fellow!

557
00:31:07,700 --> 00:31:09,120
You must be our guide!

558
00:31:12,040 --> 00:31:13,580
This is Bananas!

559
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,174
Samurai have appeared!

560
00:31:15,580 --> 00:31:17,480
I have to report this!

561
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:21,460
Samurai have come to zone!

